# Dev tools at exact versions — the ones the suite was last verified with (D-064). Each is
# installed only by CI and the local venv, never by the image. `make lock` hashes these into
# requirements-dev.lock; the runtime set comes from requirements.lock, which that file includes.
# Every package a tool needs that the runtime lock already pins (packaging, pygments,
# typing-extensions, pyyaml, tenacity) is taken from there, not repeated here.
